    <string name="owner_overview_definitions">Registered accounts = every account in Supabase Auth. Active accounts = accounts whose device opened JARVIS in the last 30 days. Active devices = last seen within 24 h. \"Currently connected\" is not shown: JARVIS has no heartbeat/presence signal, so a device can\'t be called online.</string>
