    <string name="owner_privacy_disclosure">Signed-in accounts share a minimal device record with JARVIS: a random install ID, device model, Android and app version, sign-in/app-open times, and the IP address your connection uses (read by the server). It is used only for account/device management and app analytics, visible only to the app owner, and IP addresses are deleted after 30 days. No contacts, messages, call logs, files, audio, location, IMEI or SIM data is collected. Guest mode shares none of this.</string>

